<title>USA: Metrogolf says senior managers buy shares.</title>
<headline>Metrogolf says senior managers buy shares.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metrogolf Inc said its president and chairman Charles Tourtellotte and other senior managers recently bought 18,530 shares of the company's common stock on the open market.</p>
<p>Metrogolf said that after the purchases, its senior management owned 31.4 percent of the company's shares.</p>
<p>The company acquires, develops and operates golf centers in major metropolitan areas.</p>
</text>
